            "intro": "A few helpful details before you visit. If your question is not here, just get in touch.",
            "items": [
              {
                "question": "When can I visit?",
                "answer": "See our service times below for the full weekly schedule. We would love to have you join us."
              },
              {
                "question": "Do I need to be a member to attend?",
                "answer": "No — we invite anyone and everyone to attend. Come and see, and experience the love and grace of God in person."
              },
              {
                "question": "Can I watch online?",
                "answer": "Yes. We broadcast our services live — find us on YouTube to join the gathering from anywhere."
              },
              {
                "question": "How can I get involved?",
                "answer": "From prayer and fellowship to serving in the community, there are many ways to grow and serve. Get in touch and we'll help you find your place."
              },
              {
                "question": "How do I give?",
                "answer": "We give from a willing heart, obediently and cheerfully. Get in touch for giving details, or speak with us after a service."
              },
              {
                "question": "Where are you located?",
                "answer": "Contact us for directions and service details — we would love to have you join us in person."
              }
            ]
          }
        }
